  "rules": {
    "objective": "Capture cards from the table by matching rank or summing values; score points for valuable cards (jokers, ten of diamonds, aces), for majority of cards, and for each Zwick (clearing the table). The team with the higher total after the hand wins.",
    "gameplay": "Play card to capture by rank match or value sum. Build on table cards (add/subtract to target). 'Zwick' = clearing entire table (bonus). Can't capture = trail (add card to table). Last capturer gets remaining cards.",
